    "standardized_narrative": "The Syndicate's opening gross claims outstanding at 1 January 2021 were GBP 3,340.2m. During 2021 management recorded a net prior-year release in gross claims reserves of GBP 67.7m (gross), driven predominantly by favourable claims development across a number of classes (notably Cargo, Marine Liability, Commercial Property and others) and settlements of COVID-related business interruption claims following legal clarification; however certain discontinued lines (notably US trucking liability and International Casualty) experienced material adverse development. Catastrophe events in 2021 (Uri, European floods, Hurricane Ida and US tornadoes) exceeded expectation and were reflected in 2021 loss reserves. Management notes inflationary and other uncertainties that could affect long-tail liabilities going forward.",
